      "x": 1169,
      "y": 434,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 56,
      "text": "Request path: Browser cache (HIT 40%) \u2192 CDN (HIT 70%) \u2192 Redis GET user:123 (HIT 85%) \u2192 SELECT * FROM users WHERE id=123\nCache hierarchy: Each tier absorbs misses from the tier before it \u2014 DB only sees ~15% of total requests",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
